<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Insta Health World — Healthcare, dispatched to your door</title>
<meta name="description" content="Doctor on call, ambulance on call, nurse on call, home care, lab tests and hospital setup at home — dispatched across the city, plus research and publication support for medical professionals.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#EEF0E5;
    --paper-dim:#E4E7D9;
    --ink:#131F1B;
    --ink-soft:#3C463F;
    --navy:#1C2B3E;
    --navy-soft:#2A3E56;
    --emergency:#C23B22;
    --emergency-dim:#A6321C;
    --teal:#2E6F5E;
    --teal-soft:#DCE7E0;
    --gold:#C99A3E;
    --line: rgba(19,31,27,0.14);
    --line-strong: rgba(19,31,27,0.28);
    --radius: 2px;
    --display: 'Fraunces', serif;
    --body: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--body);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.01ms !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
  }

  .wrap{max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px;}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  header.nav{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:var(--paper);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 0;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:1.28rem;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .brand-mark{
    width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--navy);
    position:relative;
    flex:none;
  }
  .brand-mark::before, .brand-mark::after{
    content:''; position:absolute; background:var(--paper);
  }
  .brand-mark::before{ width:14px; height:2.4px; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); }
  .brand-mark::after{ width:2.4px; height:14px; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); }

  nav.links{display:flex; gap:28px; font-size:0.94rem; font-weight:500;}
  nav.links a{text-decoration:none; opacity:0.78; transition:opacity 0.15s;}
  nav.links a:hover{opacity:1;}

  .call-btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    background:var(--emergency); color:#fff;
    padding:10px 18px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.92rem;
    font-family:var(--mono); letter-spacing:0.02em;
    transition:background 0.15s;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .call-btn:hover{background:var(--emergency-dim);}
  .call-btn .dot{
    width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:#fff;
    animation:pulse 1.6s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:0.35;}}

  .menu-toggle{display:none; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:6px;}
  .menu-toggle span{display:block; width:22px; height:2px; background:var(--ink); margin:5px 0;}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    nav.links{display:none;}
    .menu-toggle{display:block;}
  }

  /* ---------- HERO / DISPATCH BOARD ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:64px 0 56px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:56px; align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px;}
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.78rem; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--emergency); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:18px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:''; width:16px; height:1px; background:var(--emergency); display:inline-block;}

  h1{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 4.6vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height:1.04; letter-spacing:-0.015em; margin:0 0 22px;
  }
  h1 em{font-style:italic; color:var(--teal); font-weight:500;}

  .hero p.lede{
    font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:46ch; margin:0 0 30px;
  }

  .hero-ctas{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:34px;}
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--navy); color:#fff; padding:13px 24px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.96rem; display:inline-block;
    transition:background 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--navy-soft);}
  .btn-ghost{
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong); color:var(--ink); padding:12px 24px; border-radius:var(--radius);
    text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.96rem; display:inline-block;
    transition:border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink); background:rgba(19,31,27,0.04);}

  .hero-footnote{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:0.75;
  }

  /* Dispatch board card */
  .board{
    background:var(--navy); color:var(--paper);
    border-radius:4px; overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 22px 50px -20px rgba(28,43,62,0.55);
  }
  .board-head{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(238,240,229,0.14);
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.76rem; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(238,240,229,0.6);
  }
  .board-head .live{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; color:#8FCBA6;}
  .board-head .live .dot{width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#8FCBA6; animation:pulse 1.6s infinite;}
  .board-list{padding:8px 0;}
  .ticket{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto; gap:14px; align-items:center;
    padding:14px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(238,240,229,0.08);
    font-size:0.92rem;
    opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px);
    animation:ticketIn 0.5s ease forwards;
  }
  .ticket:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .ticket .code{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.76rem; color:var(--gold); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .ticket .desc{color:rgba(238,240,229,0.92);}
  .ticket .status{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.72rem; letter-spacing:0.04em;
    padding:4px 9px; border-radius:100px; white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .status.enroute{background:rgba(143,203,166,0.16); color:#8FCBA6;}
  .status.dispatched{background:rgba(201,154,62,0.18); color:var(--gold);}
  @keyframes ticketIn{to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}}

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADERS ---------- */
  .section{padding:76px 0;}
  .section.alt{background:var(--paper-dim);}
  .section-head{max-width:640px; margin-bottom:48px;}
  .section-eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.76rem; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--teal); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  h2{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.3rem);
    letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 14px; line-height:1.12;
  }
  .section-head p{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.02rem; margin:0;}

  /* ---------- SERVICE TICKETS GRID ---------- */
  .service-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4, 1fr); gap:1px;
    background:var(--line-strong);
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .service-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .service-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  .service-card{
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:26px 22px 24px;
    position:relative;
    transition:background 0.15s;
  }
  .service-grid.alt-bg .service-card{background:var(--paper-dim);}
  .service-card:hover{background:var(--teal-soft);}
  .service-code{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.74rem; color:var(--emergency); font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.04em; margin-bottom:14px; display:block;
  }
  .service-card h3{
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:1.16rem; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 8px; letter-spacing:-0.005em;
  }
  .service-card p{
    font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 16px; line-height:1.5;
  }
  .service-card .req{
    font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; color:var(--navy);
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;
  }
  .service-card .req::after{content:'→'; transition:transform 0.15s;}
  .service-card:hover .req::after{transform:translateX(3px);}

  /* ---------- HOW IT WORKS ---------- */
  .steps{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .step{
    padding:32px 30px 32px 0;
    border-right:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .step:last-child{border-right:none;}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .step{border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:26px 0;}
    .step:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  }
  .step-num{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--teal); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .step h3{font-family:var(--display); font-size:1.14rem; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 8px;}
  .step p{font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0;}

  /* ---------- RESEARCH SUPPORT (journal styling) ---------- */
  .journal-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:26px;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .journal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .journal-card{
    background:var(--navy); color:var(--paper);
    padding:30px 26px;
    border-radius:3px;
  }
  .journal-tag{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.72rem; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:16px; display:block;
  }
  .journal-card h3{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:600; font-size:1.18rem; margin:0 0 10px;
  }
  .journal-card p{
    font-size:0.9rem; color:rgba(238,240,229,0.75); margin:0; line-height:1.55;
  }

  /* ---------- TRUST STRIP ---------- */
  .trust-strip{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-strong); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }
  .trust-item{
    flex:1 1 220px;
    padding:22px 24px;
    border-right:1px solid var(--line);
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .trust-item:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .trust-item strong{display:block; font-family:var(--body); font-size:1.4rem; color:var(--ink); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px;}

  /* ---------- CONTACT / CTA ---------- */
  .cta-section{
    background:var(--navy); color:var(--paper); padding:80px 0;
  }
  .cta-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr; gap:56px; align-items:start;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .cta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .cta-section h2{color:var(--paper);}
  .cta-section .section-eyebrow{color:#8FCBA6;}
  .cta-section p{color:rgba(238,240,229,0.72); font-size:1.02rem; max-width:44ch;}

  .contact-list{list-style:none; margin:28px 0 0; padding:0;}
  .contact-list li{
    padding:16px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(238,240,229,0.14);
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .contact-list li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(238,240,229,0.14);}
  .contact-list .label{font-family:var(--mono); font-size:0.78rem; color:rgba(238,240,229,0.55); letter-spacing:0.05em; text-transform:uppercase;}
  .contact-list .value{font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:600;}
  .contact-list a.value{text-decoration:none;}
  .contact-list a.value:hover{text-decoration:underline;}

  .cta-panel{
    background:rgba(238,240,229,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(238,240,229,0.16);
    padding:30px 28px; border-radius:3px;
  }
  .cta-panel .call-btn{width:100%; justify-content:center; padding:15px; font-size:1rem;}
  .cta-panel p.note{font-size:0.84rem; color:rgba(238,240,229,0.6); margin:14px 0 0; text-align:center;}
  .whatsapp-btn{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
    width:100%; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(238,240,229,0.3); color:var(--paper);
    padding:13px; border-radius:var(--radius); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-size:0.94rem;
    margin-top:12px; transition:background 0.15s;
  }
  .whatsapp-btn:hover{background:rgba(238,240,229,0.08);}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{padding:34px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .footer-inner{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px;
    font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  footer .brand{font-size:1rem;}
  .footer-links{display:flex; gap:20px;}
  .footer-links a{text-decoration:none; opacity:0.8;}
  .footer-links a:hover{opacity:1;}

  ::selection{background:var(--gold); color:var(--ink);}

  /* focus visibility */
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--teal); outline-offset:2px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Insta Health World
    </div>
    <nav class="links" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#services">Home Care</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#research">Research Support</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="call-btn" href="tel:+918368722386">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      +91 83687 22386
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Doorstep healthcare · Available across the city</div>
      <h1>Healthcare, <em>dispatched</em><br>to your door.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Doctors, nurses, and ambulances you can call the moment you need them — plus lab tests, injections, and full hospital-grade setup, right at home.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="tel:+918368722386">Call for care now</a>
        <a class="btn-ghost" href="#services">See all services</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-footnote">DISPATCH LINE OPEN 24 / 7 &nbsp;·&nbsp; VERIFIED DOCTORS & NURSES ONLY</div>
    </div>

    <div class="board" role="img" aria-label="Sample live dispatch board showing recent service requests">
      <div class="board-head">
        <span>Dispatch Board</span>
        <span class="live"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Live</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-list">
        <div class="ticket" style="animation-delay:0.05s">
          <span class="code">DOC·01</span>
          <span class="desc">Doctor on call — Sector 12</span>
          <span class="status enroute">EN ROUTE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ticket" style="animation-delay:0.15s">
          <span class="code">LAB·06</span>
          <span class="desc">Sample collection — home visit</span>
          <span class="status dispatched">DISPATCHED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ticket" style="animation-delay:0.25s">
          <span class="code">NUR·03</span>
          <span class="desc">Nurse on call — post-op care</span>
          <span class="status enroute">EN ROUTE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ticket" style="animation-delay:0.35s">
          <span class="code">AMB·02</span>
          <span class="desc">Ambulance — non-emergency transfer</span>
          <span class="status dispatched">DISPATCHED</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ticket" style="animation-delay:0.45s">
          <span class="code">VID·08</span>
          <span class="desc">Video consultation — scheduled</span>
          <span class="status enroute">CONFIRMED</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Doorstep services</div>
      <h2>Every kind of care, brought to your home.</h2>
      <p>Request any of these directly — a verified professional is dispatched to your address, tracked from confirmation to arrival.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="service-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">DOC · 01</span>
        <h3>Doctor on call</h3>
        <p>A qualified physician visits your home for consultation, examination, and treatment.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Request a doctor</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">AMB · 02</span>
        <h3>Ambulance on call</h3>
        <p>Emergency and non-emergency transport, dispatched quickly with trained attendants on board.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Call an ambulance</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">NUR · 03</span>
        <h3>Nurse on call</h3>
        <p>Trained nursing staff for wound care, post-surgical support, elderly care, and daily monitoring.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Request a nurse</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">HOM · 04</span>
        <h3>Home care services</h3>
        <p>Ongoing caregiver support for recovery, chronic illness, or elderly care — built around your schedule.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Set up home care</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">INJ · 05</span>
        <h3>Injection at home</h3>
        <p>Prescribed injections administered safely at home by trained staff — no clinic visit needed.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Book an injection</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">LAB · 06</span>
        <h3>Lab test at home</h3>
        <p>Sample collection at your doorstep, with reports delivered directly to you.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Book a lab test</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">SET · 07</span>
        <h3>Hospital setup at home</h3>
        <p>Hospital-grade beds, oxygen, monitors, and equipment installed at home for serious or long-term care.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Enquire about setup</a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <span class="service-code">VID · 08</span>
        <h3>Doctor consultation — video call</h3>
        <p>Speak with a doctor over video when an in-person visit isn't needed. Prescriptions provided digitally.</p>
        <a class="req" href="tel:+918368722386">Book a video call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section alt" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">How it works</div>
      <h2>From call to care, in three steps.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Call or book</h3>
        <p>Call the dispatch line or send your request with your address and what you need.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>A professional is dispatched</h3>
        <p>We assign a verified doctor, nurse, or ambulance nearest to you and confirm your booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Care, at your doorstep</h3>
        <p>Your care arrives at your home — tracked, on time, and handled with full professionalism.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="research">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">For doctors & researchers</div>
      <h2>Support beyond the bedside.</h2>
      <p>Alongside patient care, we support clinicians and medical students with the academic work that comes with practicing medicine.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="journal-grid">
      <div class="journal-card">
        <span class="journal-tag">Case discussion</span>
        <h3>Case report discussion</h3>
        <p>Structured review and discussion of clinical case reports — useful for teaching rounds, documentation, or preparing a case for publication.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="journal-card">
        <span class="journal-tag">Research writing</span>
        <h3>Proposal writing support</h3>
        <p>Help structuring and refining research proposals, from study design through to a submission-ready document.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="journal-card">
        <span class="journal-tag">Publication</span>
        <h3>Manuscript publication support</h3>
        <p>Guidance through drafting, formatting, and submitting manuscripts to medical journals.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="trust-strip">
